#: screens/sui_menu.lua:2660
msgid ""
"By default the cover is stretched to fill the whole screen, which can "
"distort it if its proportions don't match your screen's. When on, the cover "
"keeps its original proportions instead, centered over a black background."
msgstr ""
"Standardmäßig wird das Cover gestreckt, um den gesamten Bildschirm zu "
"füllen, was es verzerren kann, wenn die Proportionen nicht zum Bildschirm "
"passen. Wenn aktiviert, behält das Cover stattdessen seine ursprünglichen "
